{
  "borough": "Merton",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Approved",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby approved shall prioritise the accommodation of children registered as residents of Merton Council first. In the event that there are places in the home and Merton Council&#39;s Children&#39;s Services department are not able to identify any children that could be suitably accommodated in it within 4 weeks (28 days) of notification of vacancy from the applicant, the development may accommodate children that are registered as residents of other boroughs.REASON: To ensure the provision of adequate care homes for Merton residents in accordance with policy H11.4 and H11.5.",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Commencement of development (Full Permission)</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development to which\r\nthis permission relates shall be commenced not later than the expiration of 3\r\nyears from the date of this permission.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">  To comply with Section 91\r\n(as amended) of the Town & Country Planning Act 1990.</span></span></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Approved Plans</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out\r\nin accordance with the following approved plans: [insert plans]</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: For the avoidance of doubt and in the interests of proper\r\nplanning</span></span></span></p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The Noise Management Plan (NMP) dated&amp;nbsp;04/06/2026 hereby approved shall be complied with for the lifetime of the use unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local\r\nPlanning Authority.&amp;nbsp;\r\n&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nReason: To ensure the operation of the children’s care home does\r\nnot result in unacceptable noise impacts on neighbouring occupiers, in\r\naccordance with Policy D12.3 of the Merton Local Plan, Policy D14 of the London\r\nPlan, and the aims of the NPPF.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Refuse & Recycling (Implementation) </span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">- The development hereby\r\napproved shall not be occupied until the refuse and recycling storage\r\nfacilities shown on the approved plans have been fully implemented and made\r\navailable for use. These facilities shall thereafter be retained for use at all\r\ntimes.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">:  To ensure the provision\r\nof satisfactory facilities for the storage of refuse and recycling material and\r\nto comply with the following Development Plan policies for Merton: policies T4\r\nand T7 of the London Plan 2021 and policy \r\nW14.4 of the Local Plan 2024.  </span></span></span></p>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Refuse stored</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - No refuse or waste material of any description\r\nshall be left or stored anywhere on the site other than within a building or\r\nrefuse enclosure.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: To safeguard the appearance of the property and the\r\namenities of the area and to accord with Policies D3 and D6 of the London Plan\r\n2021and policy D12.3 of the Local Plan 2024.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:\r\n\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">﻿</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">No External Lighting</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - No external lighting shall be installed without\r\nthe prior approval in writing of the Local Planning Authority.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;\r\nfont-family:\" arial\",sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:aptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:=\"\" minor-latin;mso-ansi-language:en-gb;mso-fareast-language:en-us;mso-bidi-language:=\"\" ar-sa\"=\"\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\" arial\",sans-serif\"=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason:  </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">To safeguard the amenities of the area and\r\nthe occupiers of neighbouring properties and ensure compliance with the\r\nfollowing Development Plan policies for Merton: policies D12.1 & D12.3 of\r\nthe Local Plan 2024.</span><o:p></o:p></span></p>",
    "<p style=\"text-align: justify; \"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Cycle Parking to be implemented</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> - The development hereby permitted shall\r\nnot be occupied until the cycle parking shown on the plans hereby approved has\r\nbeen provided and made available for use. These facilities shall be retained\r\nfor the occupants of and visitors to the development at all times.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%;\"><u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Reason</span></u><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">: To ensure satisfactory facilities for cycle parking\r\nare provided and to comply with the following Development Plan policies for\r\nMerton: policy T5 of the London Plan 2021 and policies T16.1 and T16.2 of the\r\nLocal Plan 2024.</span></span><o:p></o:p></p>"
  ],
